<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Dev. Cat — Digital Craftsmanship</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@300;400;600&family=Noto+Serif+JP:wght@200;300;400&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        :root {
            --noir: #0A0A0A;
            --surface: #141414;
            --card: #1C1C1C;
            --pearl: #F0EDE8;
            --ash: #7A7A76;
            --muted: #4A4A47;
            --accent: #8A9A5B;
            --accent-soft: rgba(138, 154, 91, 0.15);
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'DM Sans', 'Noto Serif JP', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--noir);
            color: var(--pearl);
            line-height: 1.8;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        .serif {
            font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', 'Noto Serif JP', serif;
            font-weight: 300;
        }

        /* ── Side Navigation ── */
        .side-nav {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 72px;
            height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 2.5rem 0;
            z-index: 1000;
            border-right: 1px solid rgba(240, 237, 232, 0.06);
        }

        .side-nav .logo {
            writing-mode: vertical-rl;
            text-orientation: mixed;
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.25em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--pearl);
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .side-nav-links {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 2rem;
            list-style: none;
        }

        .side-nav-links a {
            writing-mode: vertical-rl;
            text-orientation: mixed;
            color: var(--ash);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.65rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.15em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .side-nav-links a:hover {
            color: var(--accent);
        }

        .side-nav .scroll-hint {
            width: 1px;
            height: 40px;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--accent), transparent);
            animation: pulse-down 2s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        @keyframes pulse-down {
            0%, 100% { opacity: 0.3; }
            50% { opacity: 1; }
        }

        /* ── Main Content ── */
        main {
            margin-left: 72px;
        }

        /* ── Hero ── */
        .hero {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            position: relative;
        }

        .hero-left {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 6rem 5rem;
        }

        .hero-pretitle {
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.35em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--accent);
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .hero-pretitle::before {
            content: '';
            display: inline-block;
            width: 32px;
            height: 1px;
            background: var(--accent);
        }

        .hero-title {
            font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.5vw, 4.2rem);
            line-height: 1.3;
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 300;
        }

        .hero-sub {
            color: var(--ash);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            max-width: 400px;
            line-height: 2;
        }

        .hero-right {
            background: var(--surface);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .hero-right::before {
            content: '正射必中';
            font-family: 'Noto Serif JP', serif;
            font-size: clamp(6rem, 12vw, 14rem);
            font-weight: 200;
            color: rgba(240, 237, 232, 0.03);
            position: absolute;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        .hero-emblem {
            width: 120px;
            height: 120px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(138, 154, 91, 0.3);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            position: relative;
        }

        .hero-emblem::after {
            content: '';
            width: 6px;
            height: 6px;
            background: var(--accent);
            border-radius: 50%;
        }

        /* ── Work Section ── */
        .work {
            padding: 8rem 5rem;
            background: var(--surface);
        }

        .section-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 6rem;
        }

        .section-label {
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.35em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--accent);
        }

        .section-line {
            flex: 1;
            height: 1px;
            background: rgba(240, 237, 232, 0.06);
        }

        .project-showcase {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 5fr 7fr;
            gap: 4rem;
            align-items: start;
        }

        .project-meta {
            position: sticky;
            top: 6rem;
        }

        .project-number {
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            color: var(--muted);
            letter-spacing: 0.2em;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .project-title {
            font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 3.5rem);
            font-weight: 300;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        .project-desc {
            color: var(--ash);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 2;
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
        }

        .project-link {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--pearl);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.1em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            padding: 0.8rem 1.8rem;
            border: 1px solid rgba(240, 237, 232, 0.15);
            transition: all 0.4s ease;
        }

        .project-link:hover {
            border-color: var(--accent);
            color: var(--accent);
            background: var(--accent-soft);
        }

        .project-link .arrow {
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .project-link:hover .arrow {
            transform: translateX(4px);
        }

        .project-visual {
            background: var(--card);
            aspect-ratio: 4/3;
            border-radius: 3px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .project-visual::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            border: 1px solid rgba(240, 237, 232, 0.04);
            border-radius: 3px;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .project-visual-text {
            font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
            font-size: 3rem;
            color: rgba(240, 237, 232, 0.06);
            letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        }

        .project-tags {
            display: flex;
            gap: 0.75rem;
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
        }

        .tag {
            font-size: 0.65rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.1em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--muted);
            padding: 0.4rem 1rem;
            border: 1px solid rgba(240, 237, 232, 0.06);
            border-radius: 100px;
        }

        /* ── Philosophy ── */
        .philosophy {
            padding: 10rem 5rem;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            position: relative;
        }

        .philosophy::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            width: 1px;
            height: 80px;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, var(--accent), transparent);
            top: 3rem;
        }

        .philosophy-quote {
            font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.2vw, 1.8rem);
            max-width: 700px;
            text-align: center;
            line-height: 2.2;
            font-weight: 200;
            color: var(--pearl);
        }

        .philosophy-quote em {
            color: var(--accent);
            font-style: normal;
        }

        /* ── Footer ── */
        footer {
            padding: 5rem;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(240, 237, 232, 0.06);
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 3rem;
            align-items: end;
        }

        .footer-brand h2 {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            font-weight: 300;
        }

        .footer-brand p {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--muted);
        }

        .footer-contact {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .contact-cta {
            display: inline-block;
            color: var(--pearl);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.15em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            padding-bottom: 4px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--accent);
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .contact-cta:hover {
            color: var(--accent);
        }

        .footer-copy {
            text-align: right;
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            color: var(--muted);
        }

        /* ── Responsive ── */
        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .side-nav {
                display: none;
            }

            main {
                margin-left: 0;
            }

            .hero {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .hero-left {
                padding: 8rem 2rem 4rem;
            }

            .hero-right {
                min-height: 40vh;
            }

            .work {
                padding: 5rem 2rem;
            }

            .project-showcase {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .project-meta {
                position: static;
            }

            .philosophy {
                padding: 6rem 2rem;
            }

            footer {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                padding: 3rem 2rem;
                text-align: left;
            }

            .footer-contact,
            .footer-copy {
                text-align: left;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <nav class="side-nav">
        <div class="logo">Dev. Cat</div>
        <ul class="side-nav-links">
            <li><a href="#work">Work</a></li>
            <li><a href="#philosophy">Philosophy</a></li>
            <li><a href="mailto:your-email@example.com">Contact</a></li>
        </ul>
        <div class="scroll-hint"></div>
    </nav>

    <main>

        <section class="hero">
            <div class="hero-left">
                <div class="hero-pretitle">Developer & Artisan</div>
                <h1 class="hero-title serif">道具としての<br>デジタルを、<br>追求する。</h1>
                <p class="hero-sub">
                    凛とした空気感と、使い手に馴染む機能性。<br>
                    弓道の精神をデジタルプロダクトに宿します。
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-right">
                <div class="hero-emblem"></div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="work" id="work">
            <div class="section-header">
                <span class="section-label">Featured Work</span>
                <div class="section-line"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="project-showcase">
                <div class="project-meta">
                    <div class="project-number">01</div>
                    <h3 class="project-title serif">qdBase</h3>
                    <p class="project-desc">
                        弓道の的中管理に特化した、静かで強力なツール。
                        射手の集中を妨げず、記録を「写す」ためのミニマルな設計。
                        日々の稽古に、確かな指標をもたらします。
                    </p>
                    <a href="https://apps.apple.com/jp/app/qdbase-%E5%BC%93%E9%81%93%E3%81%AE%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%AD%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E3%81%AB%E7%89%B9%E5%8C%96%E3%81%97%E3%81%9F%E3%82%A2%E3%83%97%E3%83%AA/id6754814954" class="project-link" target="_blank">
                        App Storeで見る <span class="arrow">→</span>
                    </a>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <div class="project-visual">
                        <span class="project-visual-text">qdBase</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="project-tags">
                        <span class="tag">iOS</span>
                        <span class="tag">Swift</span>
                        <span class="tag">弓道</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="philosophy" id="philosophy">
            <div class="section-header" style="justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 5rem;">
                <span class="section-label">Philosophy</span>
            </div>
            <p class="philosophy-quote serif">
                <em>正射必中。</em><br>
                正しいプロセスから、正しい結果が生まれる。<br>
                コードの一行、ピクセルの一つにまで<br>
                その精神を反映させ、<br>
                時代に流されない普遍的な価値を持つ<br>
                アプリケーションを。
            </p>
        </section>

        <footer>
            <div class="footer-brand">
                <h2 class="serif">Dev. Cat</h2>
                <p>Digital Craftsmanship</p>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-contact">
                <a href="mailto:your-email@example.com" class="contact-cta">Connect via Email</a>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-copy">
                &copy; 2026 Dev. Cat. All rights reserved.
            </div>
        </footer>

    </main>

</body>
</html>
